  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "##  1. Вычислить предел: $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\infty}(1+\\frac{5}{x})^{3x}$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/latex": [
       "$\\displaystyle \\lim_{x \\to \\infty} \\left(1 + \\frac{5}{x}\\right)^{3 x} = e^{15}$"
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "           3⋅x      \n",
       "    ⎛    5⎞       15\n",
       "lim ⎜1 + ─⎟    = ℯ  \n",
       "x─→∞⎝    x⎠         "
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 2,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "x = symbols('x')\n",
    "y = Limit((1 + 5 / x) ** (3 * x), x, oo)\n",
    "Eq(y, y.doit())"
   ]
  },
